    <h1>An accountant first.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Trained in accounting, and in the habit of building.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="page__body prose-block narrow">
    <p>I'm a CPA based in Sydney. I studied accounting at UNSW, and accounting is still how I think: a number is only as good as the evidence under it and the person prepared to sign it.</p>
    <p>Somewhere along the way I started writing code to remove the repetitive parts of the work. That grew into building automation and AI workflows for finance, and then into building software for its own sake. I treat it as a bonus. It makes the accounting faster and easier to check, and it doesn't change who is responsible for the result.</p>
    <p>I write here about both, mostly where they meet.</p>
  </div>

